Third-party components
----------------------

Hand tracking models (src/mimedcontrol/models/palm.onnx and hand.onnx)
  The MediaPipe palm detection and hand landmark models, converted to ONNX and
  published by the OpenCV Zoo project:
    https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/palm_detection_mediapipe
    https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/handpose_estimation_mediapipe
  The original models are part of Google MediaPipe:
    https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of the license ships
  with the models in src/mimedcontrol/models/LICENSE.
